 summer/early fall for Nov–Apr peak; late spring for green-season value"},"jewels":[{"name":"Gallery District Art Walk","si_tag":"Culture & Arts","status":"future","hook":"Thursday-night open-gallery cobblestone stroll, free, Nov–Jun","bookable_category":"free / bundle with dining","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.ivanguaderrama.com/san-jose-del-cabo-art-walk-guide/ (Accessed 2026-07-04)","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"Culture & Arts","blurb":"Thursday-night open-gallery cobblestone stroll, free, Nov–Jun","when":"year-round","commission":"adjacent dining/experience or hotel package","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Estero de San José birding","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","hook":"270+ species freshwater lagoon reserve, endangered Belding''s Yellowthroat","bookable_category":"guided birding tour","tier":"comfort","source":"http://mexicobirdingtrail.org/plan-a-trip/san-jose-del-cabo-estuary/ (Accessed 2026-07-04)","timing":"November–April","when_source":"derived from destination timing","timing_type":"SEASONAL-WINDOW","si":"expedition","blurb":"270+ species freshwater lagoon reserve, endangered Belding''s Yellowthroat","when":"November–April","commission":"activity affiliate / DMC","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Whale-watching (Corridor)","si_tag":"Global Expedition Adventures","status":"live","hook":"Humpback + gray whale tours, ~90–95% peak sightings","bookable_category":"panga/catamaran tour","tier":"comfort","source":"https://www.cabo-adventures.com/en/tour/whale-watching-in-cabo (Accessed 2026-07-04)","si":"expedition","blurb":"Humpback + gray whale tours, ~90–95% peak sightings","commission":"activity affiliate / Amstar DMC","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Playa Palmilla swim/snorkel","si_tag":"Ocean Adventures","status":"future","hook":"Blue Flag, protected swim beach fronting One&Only","bookable_category":"free beach + snorkel add-ons","tier":"essential","source":"https://www.casanatalia.com/nearby-attractions/san-jose-del-cabo-beaches/ (Accessed 2026-07-04)","si":"ocean","blurb":"Blue Flag, protected swim beach fronting One&Only","commission":"activity affiliate","accessed":"2026-07-04"},{"name":"Corridor golf + spa day","si_tag":"Romance & Honeymoons","status":"live","hook":"27-hole/championship golf + resort spas for couples","bookable_category":"tee times + spa via resort/DMC","tier":"premier","source":"https://www.oneandonlyresorts.com/palmilla (Accessed 2026-07-04)","timing":"year-round","timing_type":"ALWAYS-ON","si":"romance","blurb":"27-hole/championship golf + resort spas for couples","when":"year-round","commission":"DMC / resort","accessed":"2026-07-04"}],"faq":[{"q":"Where''s the top end for a honeymoon in San José?","a":"San José/Palmilla is the branded-ultra spine of Los Cabos: One&Only Palmilla (the 1956-origin icon, 27-hole golf), Zadún (a Ritz-Carlton Reserve, 115 villas), Chileno Bay and Esperanza (Auberge). It''s the quiet, composed counterweight to Cabo San Lucas'' nightlife.","source":"virtuoso.com / guide.michelin.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"romance"},{"q":"When can I see whales, and is the estuary worth it?","a":"Whale season is mid-December to mid-April with ~90–95% sightings at peak (mother-calf pairs Jan–Feb). For nature on land, the Estero de San José — BCS''s only freshwater coastal lagoon and an Important Bird Area — holds 270+ bird species, best at dawn.","source":"visitloscabos.travel / mexicobirdingtrail.org, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"expedition"},{"q":"Which San José beaches can I actually swim?","a":"Very few — most open Corridor beaches have strong currents and are not swim-safe. The reliable exception is Blue Flag Playa Palmilla, with a protected swimming area; Chileno and Santa María are the other Corridor swim beaches.","source":"casanatalia.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"ocean"},{"q":"What is the Art Walk, and when is it?","a":"Every Thursday evening, 5–9 pm, November through June, the Gallery District opens more than a dozen galleries along the cobblestone streets around Álvaro Obregón, with music and refreshments — and it''s free. Book Art Walk-night dinner ahead Dec–March.","source":"ivanguaderrama.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"culture"},{"q":"What''s the real risk to plan for?","a":"The ocean and the weather, not crime. Most open San José beaches have dangerous rip currents — swim only at Blue Flag Palmilla or other designated coves — and hurricane season runs Jun–Nov, September historically worst. Carry trip insurance for green-season dates.","source":"casanatalia.com / mexiconewsdaily.com, 2026-07-04","si_tag":"safety"}],"seo":{"meta_title":"San José del Cabo Travel Guide — Art Walk, Whales & Blue Flag Beaches | TravelWell.World","meta_description":"The refined side of Los Cabos: Gallery District Art Walk, Estero San José birding, whale-watching, swim-safe Playa Palmilla, and branded-ultra resorts.","slug":"san-jose-del-cabo-mexico","primary_keyword":"San José del Cabo travel guide","long_tail":["San José del Cabo Art Walk Thursday","San José del Cabo vs Cabo San Lucas","Playa Palmilla swimming","whale watching San José del Cabo","luxury resorts San José del Cabo"],"search_language":"es-MX","local_keywords":["qué hacer en San José del Cabo","Art Walk San José del Cabo horarios","Estero de San José del Cabo aves","Playa Palmilla se puede nadar","avistamiento de ballenas Los Cabos","hoteles de lujo San José del Cabo"],"hreflang":["en","es-MX"],"jsonld_type":"TouristDestination","content_freshness":"2026-07-04"},"booking":null,"si_checklist_25":null,"sis_present":[{"si":"romance","status":"live"},{"si":"expedition","status":"live"},{"si":"culture","status":"future"},{"si":"ocean","status":"future"}],"ultra":[{"name":"One&Only Palmilla","why_ultra":"Legendary 1956-origin 174-room Sea-of-Cortez retreat, 13 private-villa spa, 27-hole golf; Palmilla = San José","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"resort credit + upgrade + breakfast (verify current)","mor":true},{"name":"Chileno Bay Resort & Residences (Auberge)","why_ultra":"Auberge; Mykonos-white low-rise, football-field pool, swim-safe Chileno beach","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"verify","mor":true},{"name":"Esperanza, Auberge Resorts Collection","why_ultra":"Clifftop Corridor Auberge classic","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"verify","mor":true},{"name":"Viceroy Los Cabos","why_ultra":"Design-forward San José Corridor resort","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"verify","mor":true},{"name":"Zadún, a Ritz-Carlton Reserve","why_ultra":"San José coastline; 115 villas (many private-pool) + Residences, 2 championship courses, botanical park; 4th Reserve globally","earning":"on application / via host-Virtuoso","virtuoso_value_add":"verify","mor":true}],"source_verified":"2026-07-04","hero":{"query":"San José del Cabo, Mexico"},"geo":{"lat":23.0631,"lng":-109.7025}}'::jsonb, 99),
